    "detailed_description": "666 Second Rule an Unholy Adventure<br><br>666 Second Rule is a short action game where you take the role of a messed-up parent pretending to care about your child and using the dark forces on your  journey. The baby is on the dirty-dirty ground. You know what can happen!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540110/extras/d94d65514d915cf231812b3a96cb1793.poster.avif?t=1708423229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540110/extras/d94d65514d915cf231812b3a96cb1793.webm?t=1708423229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540110/extras/d94d65514d915cf231812b3a96cb1793.mp4?t=1708423229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc1c Slay Swarms of Insects \ud83d\udc1c</h2><br>Arm yourself with swift reflexes and battle through hordes of pesky insects! With each foe vanquished, collect their legs as dark currency to unlock the secrets of the shadow realm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540110/extras/305ae1f4939b8d4f51f11a1bbfc81448.poster.avif?t=1708423229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540110/extras/305ae1f4939b8d4f51f11a1bbfc81448.webm?t=1708423229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540110/extras/305ae1f4939b8d4f51f11a1bbfc81448.mp4?t=1708423229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc5f Upgrade Your Arsenal \ud83d\udc5f</h2><br>Experience the thrill of wielding new, stronger slippers as you progress through the twisted narrative. Crush your enemies with enhanced power and show no mercy to those who stand in your way!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540110/extras/635078158cfd517f6c1d01dc8f2eb19e.poster.avif?t=1708423229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540110/extras/635078158cfd517f6c1d01dc8f2eb19e.webm?t=1708423229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540110/extras/635078158cfd517f6c1d01dc8f2eb19e.mp4?t=1708423229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f Harness Sinister Powers \ud83c\udf1f</h2><br>Delve deeper into the occult and harness the might of pentagrams and other dark powers. Unleash devastating spells and bend the forces of nature to your will!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540110/extras/1736823782a52db3c8e389b3f50b3a88.poster.avif?t=1708423229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540110/extras/1736823782a52db3c8e389b3f50b3a88.webm?t=1708423229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540110/extras/1736823782a52db3c8e389b3f50b3a88.mp4?t=1708423229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u274c Desperate Times, Desperate Measures \u274c</h2><br>The child's life hangs in the balance, but beware - the path to redemption is riddled with malevolence. Can you navigate through the twisted choices and save the cute innocent baby from the clutches of the darkness?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Experience 666 Second Rule Now! \ud83c\udfae</h2><br>Embark on this gripping action-packed journey, fraught with sinister powers and a heart-stopping quest to rescue the child from a fate worse than death!<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 WISHLIST NOW \ud83d\udd25",
